# Raw generated artwork drop-off: full-size renders, background removals, working files.
# The SHIPPED artwork is the processed 512x512 PNGs committed under server/seed-images/
# (~15MB, loaded by `npm run seed:images`). Originals are only needed to re-process at a
# different size, so they stay local and out of git history.
images/
